# Lineages.gd
# The playable tree of life, keyed by the path of choices made so far
# ("" = start, "2" = third card after era 1, "2,0" = then the first card, ...).
#
# Rule from the design doc: every playable form is a group that still has
# living members. Extinct animals (Dunkleosteus, Meganeuropsis, gorgonopsids,
# ammonites...) are bosses, enemies or codex cousins, never playable.
#
# Stats, attack types and perks use the mechanics in Player.gd and Tear.gd.
# "weapon" picks a style from WEAPONS below: a real feeding or defence tool
# of the animal, so a cell releases lysosome vesicles and a shark bites.
# A form whose path has no children offers an in-clade upgrade instead
# (see Player.apply_evolution), because no real split is known there.
